-\paragraph{Calibration.} We lead with the shipped baseline's confidence, the number users see. With the
-controls excluded, isotonic calibration lowers its ECE from 0.323 to 0.069 on v0.1 and from 0.293 to 0.063 on
-v0.2 (79\% each; Brier 0.305$\to$0.198 and 0.266$\to$0.169). For the hybrid's fused-score confidence, ECE
-falls from 0.329 to 0.108 (67\%) and from 0.368 to 0.071 (81\%). Each reduction has one-sided paired-bootstrap
